      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fort_Gratiot_Township%2C_Michigan",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "A stop on the historic Pere Marquette Railway once served Fort Gratiot, linking it to regional trade routes.",
